            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esau walóla achetu a Chikanani: Ada mwana wa Eloni, Muhiti, na Oholibama, mwana wa Ana, mdzukulu wa Sibeoni, Mhivi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.25.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mwandzo 25:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.28.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "28:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piya walóla Basemathi, mwana wa Isimaili,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36:3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Esau na Isimaili kala ni mutu na ise mvyere mwanababa.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ndugungbwa mchetu wa Nebayothi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ada wavyala Elifazi na Basemathi achivyala Reueli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oholibama wavyala Jeushi, Jalamu na Kora. Hano ni ana alume a Esau, ambao avyalwa tsi ya Kanani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halafu Esau wahala achee, anae alume na achetu na atue osi a phakpwe kaya, phamwenga na mifugoye yosi na malize zosi arizozitsuma tsi ya Kanani, achitsama tsi yanjina kure na nduguye Jakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watsama kpwa sababu tsi yosagala kala taiatosha iye na Jakobo. Taayaweza kpwenderera kusagala phamwenga, mana osi kala ana mifugo minji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo Edomu (yani Esau) achendasagala tsi ya myango ya Seiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hivi ndivyo vivyazi vya Esau, mkarengbwa wa Aedomu, hiko kpwenye myango ya Seiri: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ada, mkpwaza Esau, wavyala mwana mlume Elifazi naye wavyala ana atsano alume: Temani, Omari, Sefo, Gatamu na Kenazi. Piya wavyala mwana mlume wanjina na mwanachetuwe yeihwa Timuna; mwana hiyu waihwa Amaleki. Naye Basemathi, mkpwaza Esau, wavyala mwana mlume yemuiha Reueli. Hiyu Reueli wavyala ana a ne alume: Nahathi, Zera, Shama na Miza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.10+GEN.36.11+GEN.36.12+GEN.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.10",
              "GEN.36.11",
              "GEN.36.12",
              "GEN.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mchetu wanjina wa Esau kala ni Oholibama, mwana wa Ana, mdzukulu wa Sibeoni. Oholibama wavyala ana ahahu alume: Jeushi, Jalamu na Kora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hano kala ndio madzumbe a chivyazi cha Esau: Ana alume a Elifazi, mwana mvyere wa Esau, kala ni madzumbe hano: Temani, Omari, Sefo, Kenazi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kora, Gatamu na Amaleki. Hano kala ni atu kula Edomu, adzukulu a Ada, mkpwaza Esau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana alume a Reueli kpwenye tsi ya Edomu kala ni madzumbe hano: Nahathi, Zera, Shama na Miza. Hano kala ni adzukulu a Basemathi, mkpwaza Esau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana alume a Oholibama, mkpwaza Esau, kala ni madzumbe hinya: Jeushi, Jalamu na Kora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi, huno ndio uvyazi wa Esau (yani Edomu), chila mmwenga kala ni dzumbe wa mbariye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seiri, mutu wa kabila ra Ahori, kala ni mwenyezi wa tsi iyo. Hano ndio anae alume: Lotani, Shobali, Sibeoni, Ana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dishoni, Eseri na Dishani. Hinya kala ni madzumbe a Ahori, ana a Seiri hiko tsi ya Edomu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana alume a Lotani kala ni Hori na Hemani. (Lotani kala ana nduguye mchetu yeihwa Timuna).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana alume a Shobali kala ni Alivani, Manahathi, Ebali, Shefo na Onamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
